#: src/menus/help/user-manual.xml:5(title)
#: src/menus/help/user-manual.xml:8(primary)
msgid "User Manual"
msgstr "Manual do usuário"

#: src/menus/help/user-manual.xml:12(title)
#| msgid "The <quote>GIMP Online</quote> submenu of the Help menu"
msgid "The <quote>User Manual</quote> submenu of the Help menu"
msgstr "O submenu <quote>GIMP online</quote> do menu Ajuda"

#: src/menus/help/user-manual.xml:19(para)
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>User Manual</guimenuitem> command displays a submenu which "
"lists links to several parts of the user manual. Clicking on one of them "
"will open the desired user manual topic. Depending on your <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-prefs-help\">help preferences</link> this will open either "
"the local or online user manual, either in your browser or in GIMP's own "
"help browser."
msgstr ""
"O comando <guimenuitem>Manual do usuário</guimenuitem> exibe um submenu que "
"lista links para várias partes do manual do usuário. Clicar em um deles "
"abrirá o tópico desejado do manual. Dependendo das suas <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-prefs-help\">preferências de ajuda</link>, isso abrirá o "
"manual local ou o online, seja no seu navegador ou no navegador de ajuda do "
"próprio GIMP."

#: src/menus/help/tip-of-the-day.xml:11(title)
#: src/menus/help/tip-of-the-day.xml:15(secondary)
#: src/menus/help/tip-of-the-day.xml:18(primary)
msgid "Tip of the Day"
msgstr "Dica do dia"

#: src/menus/help/tip-of-the-day.xml:21(para)
#| msgid ""
#| "The <guimenuitem>Tip of the Day</guimenuitem> command displays the "
#| "<guimenu>Tip of the Day</guimenu> dialog. This dialog contains useful tips "
#| "to help you gain a better understanding of some of the subtle points of "
#| "using <acronym>GIMP</acronym>. New users will find it very valuable to pay "
#| "attention to these, because they often suggest ways of doing something that "
#| "are much easier or more efficient than more obvious approaches."
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Tip of the Day</guimenuitem> dialog contains useful tips to"
" help you gain a better understanding of some of the subtle points of using "
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym>. The tips often suggest ways of doing something that"
" are much easier or more efficient than more obvious approaches."
msgstr ""
"A caixa de diálogo <guimenuitem>Dica do dia</guimenuitem> contém dicas úteis"
" para ajudá-lo a entender melhor alguns pontos sutis do uso do "
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym>. As dicas frequentemente sugerem formas de fazer "
"algo muito mais fáceis ou eficientes do que abordagens mais óbvias."

#: src/menus/help/tip-of-the-day.xml:28(para)
msgid ""
"Some tips contain a <guilabel>Learn more</guilabel> link to the "
"corresponding <acronym>GIMP</acronym> manual page."
msgstr ""
"Algumas dicas possuem um link de <guilabel>Aprenda mais</guilabel> que "
"levará para a página do manual do <acronym>GIMP</acronym> correspondente."

#: src/menus/help/tip-of-the-day.xml:35(para)
#| msgid ""
#| "You can access this command in the image menu through "
#| "<menuchoice><guimenu>Help</guimenu><guimenuitem>Tip of the "
#| "Day</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the main menu through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Help</guimenu><guimenuitem>Tip of the "
"Day</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Você pode acessar este comando no menu da janela de imagem através de "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Ajuda</guimenu><guimenuitem>Dica do "
"dia</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

